                                                "sense_id": "c5c0a785-f71e-316b-a2a7-4e4f7863326c",
                                                "text": "He proposes to set up his own business."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c00dbb83-5d6e-4d39-98ff-d2750337cd97",
                                                "sense_id": "c5c0a785-f71e-316b-a2a7-4e4f7863326c",
                                                "text": "I propose to relate, in several volumes, the history of the people of New England."
